docs {
  TICK-672 (P6-07, ADR-005 §3.2, §4.2): the tenant-admin number-format routes. Needs the stack with M3 applied, so a non-default format is accepted. Each request asserts one documented status. Formats are keyed per run, so the folder can run again.
